#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kiriki.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Kiriki is an addictive and fun dice game, designed to be played by as many as six players. Participants have to collect points by rolling five dice for up to three times per single turn."
msgstr "Kiriki je zarazna i zabavna igra kockicama za najviše šest igrača. Igrači skupljaju bodove bacanjem pet kockica do tri puta u svakom potezu."
